record.dic_text:
06080 `aphar {a:-far'}

字根型, 或意為"使變灰色"或更可能意為"磨成粉末";
   只用作 06083 的動名詞, 意為"使塵土飛揚"; TWOT - 1664; 動詞

欽定本 - cast 1; 1

1) (Piel) 撒之以塵土 (#撒下 16:13|)

record.edic_text:
06080 `aphar {aw-far'}

a primitive root: meaning either to be gray or perhaps rather to
   pulverise; used only as denominative from 06083, to be dust;
   TWOT - 1664; v

AV - cast 1; 1

1) (Piel) to dust, powder
